# This file intentionally lists no addresses yet, for the same reason the
# component root's does: review falls through to the parent, which is the honest
# state while the owner roles named in the M0 milestone are unfilled. Adding a
# name here is part of closing M0, not something to guess at now.
#
# One explicit reviewer requirement survives that. The adversarial suite and the
# fuzzers are where a weakened assertion is indistinguishable from a passing
# one, and both consume data a compromised renderer controls.
per-file adversarial/*=file://ipc/SECURITY_OWNERS
per-file fuzz/*=file://ipc/SECURITY_OWNERS
per-file support/scripted_renderer_endpoint.*=file://ipc/SECURITY_OWNERS
